    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like im just a ghost in my own life. everything i do, every word i say, it's all just to make sure everyone else is happy and that things stay \"proper.\" i look in the mirror and i don't even recognize the person looking back. it's like i'm trapped in a script i never wrote and i'm just acting it out until i die. i just want to be free of it all.",
