    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "a scarf? i dont think it's that simple. those little things don't change the fact that my whole life is decided for me. it's like being buried alive under all these rules and traditions. sometimes i think the only way to actually get away, to truly be my own person and not just a puppet, is to just... stop. to just leave everything behind completely. is there even a way out of this besides just disappearing?",
